---
/**
 * Culinary & Mixology — full sunflower block (mirror of Amsterdam's yellow
 * Dining section): two full-bleed media cards with pine hairlines.
 */
---

<section class="culinary horizon-motif" aria-labelledby="culinary-title">
  <div class="page-pad">
    <div class="culinary__head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label" data-reveal>Culinary &amp; Mixology</p>
        <h2 class="culinary__title display-copy" id="culinary-title" data-split>
          Crafted for golden light
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="culinary__lead lead-copy" data-reveal>
        A kitchen that plates the Caribbean with intent, and a bar that pours
        the sunset back into the glass. Menus change with the island; the
        ritual does not.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="culinary__cards" data-reveal-stagger>
      <a href="/menu#culinary" class="culinary-card" data-reveal-item>
        <img
          src="/images/plates/signature-entree.jpg"
          alt="Chef's signature entrée with golden butter sauce"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="culinary-card__shade" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="culinary-card__body">
          <h3 class="culinary-card__name">The Kitchen</h3>
          <span class="culinary-card__meta">
            Island fusion, sushi, plant-based — from $17
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a href="/menu#drinks" class="culinary-card" data-reveal-item>
        <img
          src="/images/drinks/tropical-mixology.jpg"
          alt="Tropical mixology creations at the Horizons bar"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="culinary-card__shade" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="culinary-card__body">
          <h3 class="culinary-card__name">The Bar</h3>
          <span class="culinary-card__meta">
            Signature cocktails, tropical mixology — from $12
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="culinary__cta" data-reveal>
      <a href="/menu" class="btn btn--pine">View the full menu</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
